config ESP8089_SPI
	tristate "Espressif ESP8089 SPI WiFi support"
	depends on WLAN && MAC80211 && SPI && GPIOLIB
	depends on CFG80211
	help
	  This enables support for ESP8089 WiFi connected over SPI.
	  The driver keeps the current board-info based bring-up path and
	  expects board-specific SPI bus and IRQ numbers to be provided by
	  module parameters when loaded as a module.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module will
	  be called esp8089-spi.
